<title>NORWAY: Expansion of 2001 Norway bond gets 5.56 pct yield.</title>
<headline>Expansion of 2001 Norway bond gets 5.56 pct yield.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>MATURITY: May 31, 2001</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.0 percent</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.56 percent</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 3.0 billion crowns</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE: 105.6</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 33.3</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: annual coupon</p>
<p>NOTES: This is an expansion of bond S466 issued on May 29, 1995</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
